    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const FREE_DOMAINS = [\n  'gmail.com', 'outlook.com', 'hotmail.com', 'yahoo.com',\n  'proton.me', 'protonmail.com', 'icloud.com', 'live.com',\n  'aol.com', 'gmx.com'\n];\n\nreturn $input.all().map(item => {\n  const f = item.json;\n\n  const email = (f['Work email'] || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const domain = email.split('@')[1] || '';\n  const isFree = FREE_DOMAINS.includes(domain);\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      email,\n      domain,\n      is_free_domain: isFree,\n      website_url: (domain && !isFree) ? `https://${domain}` : '',\n      company_name: (f['Company name'] || '').trim(),\n      job_title: (f['Job title'] || '').trim().toLowerCase(),\n      size_band: f['Company size'] || '',\n      deployment: f['How are you running the platform today?'] || '',\n      wf_band: f['Roughly how many workflows in production?'] || '',\n      entry_point: 'webinar_governance',\n      submitted_at: f['submittedAt'] || new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        208,
        0
      ],
      "id": "3d387495-6e67-48c8-90bc-5f6776cbc79d",
      "name": "Normalize"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are classifying a lead for a B2B workflow automation platform.\n\nINPUT\nCompany name: {{ $json.company_name }}\nDomain: {{ $json.domain }}\nCompany size band: {{ $json.size_band }}\nWebsite title: {{ $json.page_title }}\nWebsite content: {{ $json.body_text }}\nWebsite fetch successful: {{ $json.fetch_ok }}\n\nICP\nOrganisations that run software engineering in-house and operate automation at production scale. Typically 200+ employees, with a platform, IT operations, security operations or data engineering function. Frequently in regulated or audit-heavy sectors: financial services, insurance, telecommunications, healthcare, government, aerospace. Also high-integration technology companies: SaaS platforms, marketplaces, logistics.\n\nANTI-ICP\nSolo operators, freelancers and consultancies under 20 people. Organisations with no internal engineering capability. Companies that outsource all technology delivery.\n\nTASK\nClassify the company. If \"Website fetch successful\" is false, or the website content is too sparse to judge, return \"unclear\" rather than guessing.\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn a single JSON object and nothing else. No markdown, no code fences, no commentary.\n\n{\n  \"industry\": \"short sector label, max 4 words\",\n  \"business_model\": \"B2B\" | \"B2C\" | \"both\" | \"unclear\",\n  \"has_technical_team\": \"yes\" | \"no\" | \"unclear\",\n  \"regulated_sector\": \"yes\" | \"no\" | \"unclear\",\n  \"icp_fit\": \"strong\" | \"partial\" | \"weak\" | \"none\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"one sentence, max 25 words\"\n}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        816,
        0
      ],
      "id": "7a358312-ee9d-4c36-a22b-521c147fbef2",
      "name": "Classify: ICP fit"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(item => {\n  const html = item.json.data || '';\n  const prev = $('Normalize').first().json;\n\n  const pick = (re) => {\n    const m = html.match(re);\n    return m ? m[1].trim() : '';\n  };\n\n  const title = pick(/<title[^>]*>([^<]*)<\\/title>/i);\n  const metaDesc = pick(/<meta[^>]*name=[\"']description[\"'][^>]*content=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/i);\n  const ogDesc = pick(/<meta[^>]*property=[\"']og:description[\"'][^>]*content=[\"']([^\"']*)[\"']/i);\n\n  const bodyText = html\n    .replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>/gi, ' ')\n    .replace(/<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, ' ')\n    .replace(/<!--[\\s\\S]*?-->/g, ' ')\n    .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n    .replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ')\n    .replace(/&amp;/g, '&')\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n    .trim()\n    .slice(0, 3000);\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...prev,\n      page_title: title,\n      meta_description: metaDesc || ogDesc,\n      body_text: bodyText,\n      fetch_ok: bodyText.length > 100\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        608,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "69a6dae4-ce66-4f94-b54a-673ed1857895",
      "name": "Extract page signals"
