    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this does\n\nScores and routes inbound leads from a webinar registration form.\n\nEach submission is enriched from the company domain, classified against an ICP by AI, then scored on three dimensions: firmographic fit, governance signals, and seniority.\n\nHigh fit accounts trigger an AI-generated briefing note to the SDR channel. Every lead, regardless of tier, is logged to a single sheet.",
